Debian packaging
================

This is a packaging overlay: the source is not the git tree but the pyanura
sdist from `uv build`, which becomes the `.orig.tar.gz` verbatim.
`debian/build-deb.sh` overlays `debian/` onto it and builds in an sbuild chroot.

`debian/changelog` is a placeholder, auto-stamped at build time; don't edit it.

Building locally
----------------

    # once: create the sbuild chroot
    mmdebstrap --variant=buildd trixie \
        ~/.cache/sbuild/trixie-$(dpkg --print-architecture).tar.gz

    uv build                 # produces dist/pyanura-<version>.tar.gz
    debian/build-deb.sh      # -> ./dist/*.deb
